     11       ==========================================
     12    
     13   Adapted from:
     14    
     15       Deriving a Global Social Accounting Matrix from GTAP Data
     16               By Vitaly Kharitonov, Tasneem Mirza and Terrie Walmsley
     17                               Nov 2006
     18    
     19    
     20   This program is a compliment to:
     21   Scott McDonald and Karen Thierfelder, "Deriving a Global Social Accounting
     22   Matrix from GTAP version 5 Data", Sheffield Economic Research Paper 2004:002.
     23   Dept of Economics University of Sheffield. www.shef.ac.uk/economics/serp
     24    
     25   The program was developed by Vitaly Kharitonov
     26   (Center for Global Trade Analysis, Purdue University).
